			"name": "1. Proxy-vote authorization guard",
			"description": "REQ-SFEC-001: real-HTTP e2e for board-proxy-vote-authorization-guard, driven through the actual /api/proxies* routes + Nextcloud auth middleware (not a direct controller call). Self-contained: seeds its own two non-admin probe users + one participant, tears both users and the participant down at the end.",
